OL,3,GNEWSAPark left with 'unacceptable mess'
OL,4,Aafter concert
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor has bemoaned the "totally
OL,7,Funsatisfactory" way in which Hove Park
OL,8,Fwas left after concerts last weekend.
OL,10,FIvan Lyons from Brighton & Hove City
OL,11,FCouncil (BHCC) said he had been
OL,12,Fcontacted by residents about the
OL,13,Fcondition of the park after Live at
OL,14,FHove Park finished on Sunday.
OL,16,FLyons, who represents Westdene and Hove
OL,17,FPark, wrote on Facebook: "It is totally
OL,18,Funacceptable to leave the park in such
OL,19,Fa mess...it may have rained since the
OL,20,Fconcert but to leave it like this is
OL,21,Ftotally unsatisfactory."
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
